;Front-Panel demo — drives the Elf2K front panel rather than the serial terminal.
;Turns the Q lamp on, counts $00..$1F on the two-digit output display (OUTX to the
;defined output port, Elf2K default 4), then turns Q off and halts.
;Step it, or run it slowly, to watch the digits climb.
D 4000 CD 0A 01 11 03 00 00 B3 01 06 03 42 03 86 03 00
D 4010 20 A3 01 0A 00 00 F0 00 00
D 5000 00
D 6000 00
D 7000 00
